3770757", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974780_3465087687104090_5745773893023703044_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P7xiCFIInhQQ7kNvwFZYbth&_nc_oc=AdnUDNECmYM79blS-GLRRUIsHjhezHO_3w80S8G3o8UMjabkLRcQxSbGeRS6ZPuKI6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvOw7oNs-IpdBAmEyu0AFVD9luEtrYMt4ylgG_A8UBNIQ&oe=699D8020"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-01-54.mkv_snapshot_00.25.826_1440.png", "id": "495260649347486", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974891_495260652680819_1612014108408918328_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y3rqQQL5HWgQ7kNvwGjNgFK&_nc_oc=AdmyrusjlHovAZh4BfO2JJhv4m9Ol1a5TXIlSAgmVoAVnLg5BC1LZeGCJ17kDZLJE-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfufFMWmxTKiFnXDMf_TZ1w3XSZti8N04om_UyfdHYFYWQ&oe=699DA743"}, {"file_name": "2023-01-26_16-57-00.mkv_snapshot_01.20.540_1440.png", "id": "910860627004003", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974801_910860630337336_8867062962642311624_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KTdL7X73T0oQ7kNvwEUmmiT&_nc_oc=Adlu1YS3P82mHRZTPA4jMQJe36n5EoxXwSfZf7vw-dzQLQYaRjOHpKjmJbSFVZUO2J8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuEyrjYpBeOh9PKhnQ4dsDQub9TVLmSB8b-AiwJ3AqYzg&oe=699D98BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Unification_release-trailer_thumbnail_quest.png", "id": "222585180139802", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003238_222585183473135_4209265122119070746_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=luqVpIc8SUEQ7kNvwEtrenH&_nc_oc=AdlU7C0r8-qhNGvA4h-RuvZSLxeZVu2KiSrjUvZlOu7-0_vUHnAIq93aHllw0FCHirU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuuMuti4Kkar7y1ijLE9YjFd2n3aWoXpjVCuXmdTWq7sA&oe=699D8C65"}, "display_name": "Unification", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path.\n\nFeatures:\n- Fluid and powerful physics-based movement: Feel momentum and the wind rushing past while leaping into chasms, vaulting over ledges, weaving around traps, and shifting gravity at will.\n- Kinetic tools propelling you forward: Swing above traps with a grappling hook, or glide past with a parachute. Go in guns blazing with a shotgun, or slice with a katana. Forge a new path with a jackhammer, or warp through with a teleporter.\n- Procedural destructible biomes filled with traps and enemies: Navigate through voxel cave obstacle courses with branching paths that test your reactions, knowledge, and control. Feel free to explore the depths and get lost. The handheld mini-map and conveniently placed teleporters make it easy to quickly get back on track.\n- Dreamlike upgrades: Push the limits of physics and imagination during the journey to the core with fundamental changes to the game mechanics\n- Carefully crafted controls and haptics: Each action is positioned on the controllers to allow effortless simultaneous usage of all movement and tool capabilities, inducing a flow state of control.", "short_description": "Unification is a gravity-shifting VR parkour roguevania. Descend from the orbital factory into the layers of the black hole engine. Explore vibrant shifting architectures in a harmony of momentum and destruction... assuming you\u2019re able to overcome the traps and inhabitants in your path."}]}, "developer_name": "Troy Spencer", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gist.github.com/troyspencer/7c0c9a0f5b23daf767866b9416a145fd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CrushPoint Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crushpoint.games/unification/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": 